No open-source license has been granted for this repository. All rights are reserved by the copyright holder.

This repository is public and source-visible so that its specification, its contracts, and its
governance records can be read and reviewed. Visibility is not a grant. It does not permit use,
copying, modification, merging, publication, distribution, sublicensing, or sale of this work or
of any derivative work, and it conveys no patent rights.

Selecting an outbound open-source license, fixing the terms on which contributions are accepted,
and setting the conditions under which this work may be redistributed are E14/G4 maintainer
decisions. Their current state is recorded in docs/decisions/PUBLICATION-CLEARANCE.md; the
observations behind that record are in docs/clearance/PUBLICATION-LEGAL-CLEARANCE.md.

Until that record reports a CLEARED verdict, redistribution and external contribution acceptance are refused.

The canonical-identity checks in docs/clearance/MINIMUM-NAME-CLEARANCE.md are a separate D0
decision. They are an input to the records above; they are neither repeated nor superseded here,
and they establish no legal or trademark clearance.

The maintainers named above are identified by the repository of record on GitHub. This file does
not establish, and this repository contains no evidence of, the legal identity of that holder.
